      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹16.45 (vs ₹13.77 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹16.45 (up from ₹13.77 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹2.06b (up 148% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹629.9m (up 50% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 31% (down from 51% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses.",
